#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Where do the currency and metal rates come from?"
msgstr "Bushe indalama ne mitengo ya fya mukuba fyafuma kwi?"

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "Gold and silver prices are fetched daily from Swissquote's forex data feed. For each metal, the calculator takes the midpoint of every valid bid/ask quote and uses the median of those midpoints. Currency exchange rates come from FXRatesAPI. The displayed timestamp shows when the latest complete snapshot was successfully retrieved."
msgstr "Imitengo ya golde na silfere ilasendwa cila bushiku ukufuma ku fya kulya fya ku nse ifya Swissquote. Pa cimuti cimo na cimo, icakupendapo cipoka umupaka wa cila cipimo icalinga icakubikapo/ukuipusha no kubomfya umupaka wa pakati ka iyo miputule. Imitantikile ya ndalama sha kwalula ifuma ku FXRatesAPI. Icilangililo ca nshita icalangishiwa cilanga ilyo icikope ica nomba line icapwililika casangilwe bwino bwino."

#: src/routes/+layout.svelte
msgid "About the Mithqal Calculator: a free tool for converting mithqals of gold and silver to any currency, used for Huqúqu'lláh calculations."
msgstr "Pa lwa cipe ca kupendapo: icibombelo ca buntunse ica kwalula imithqals ya golde na silfere ku ndalama iili yonse, iyabomfiwa ku kupendapo kwa Huqúqu'lláh."

