#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "The <0>Mithqál Calculator</0> is a free tool designed to help calculate the value of gold and silver in mithqáls, the traditional unit of weight used for <1>Huqúqu'lláh</1> calculations in the Bahá'í Faith."
msgstr "<0>Icipe ca kupendapo ica Mithqál</0> cibombelo ca fye icapangwa ku kwafwilisha ukupenda umutengo wa golde na silfere mu mithqáls, icipimo ca cifyalilwa ica bupimo icabomfiwa ku kupenda kwa <1>Huqúqu'lláh</1> mu Citetekelo ca Bahá'í."

#: src/routes/about/+page.svelte
msgid "I am working on a website to showcase all the great Bahai tools people have made online. The domain of the site is bahaitools.app!"
msgstr "Nalebomba pa webusaiti ku kulanga ifibombelo fyonse ifisuma ifya Bahai ifyo abantu bapanga pa Intaneti. Iciputulwa ca ncende ni ifibombelo.app!"

